# Is There a Future for Cooperative Collection Development in the Digital Age?

**Authors:** Shreeves, Edward

## Abstract
The transition to a digital environment offers new opportunities for cooperative collection development but raises questions about models based on a print environment. Examines assumptions related to cooperative collection development and resource sharing, discusses directions future cooperation in information resources might take, and suggests expertise rather than collections may be the most important resource to share. (PEN)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ539666

